# Anything that becomes a file ON a box must be LF, whatever checked it out.
#
# The Windows exe is built on windows-latest, where git ships core.autocrlf=true.
# The cloud-init host scripts ride into user-data as gz+b64, which no YAML parser
# normalises, so a CRLF checkout puts `#!/bin/bash\r` on the box and every SSH
# dies in the sshd ForceCommand. Found live 2026-09-01 (test-mineral-4).
# selfhost-cloudinit.mjs normalises too; this stops it at the source.
provisioning/host/*                        text eol=lf
provisioning/managed/cloud-init.template.yaml  text eol=lf

# Shell and node the box executes, wherever it is built or checked out.
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.mjs  text eol=lf
